YRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1}],"text":[{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","review_id":"Xaf_9CQCZMkW3LgpoAuRiA","date":"2015-03-20T20:40:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9463224411010742,"text_excerpt":"Came here for a late lunch and got breakfast items which were all amazing. Crawfish étouffée is to die for. I got the chicken and waffles which were amazing and served with a sweet and spicy sauce over sweet potato waffles! My friends got the Jewish coonass which she said was amazing. The drinks were good as well I got a mimosa and my friend got the sweet potato beer both delicious. Our server was Georgia and she was very attentive and a great server! Love the atmosphere and the neighborhood. This is defiantly my new favorite spot"},{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","review_id":"g10BN7lwghL9DdLGw1jm2A","date":"2015-10-25T16:15:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9367011785507202,"text_excerpt":"We went here last night and i loved it! The atmosphere was great and everyone was very welcoming. They have a list of fancy drinks that all sounded delicious, but we opted for a couple of beers. The food was awesome! I got the crawfish etoufee and my boyfriend got their chicken and waffles. We were both very satisfied with our meals and everything was fairly priced. Will definitely come back again the next time we are in town."},{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","review_id":"VT8AGIxtDThM9wXIADFAaA","date":"2017-08-30T00:39:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9337400197982788,"text_excerpt":"My friend and I headed here on a weekday on a whim, and it was such a good decision on our part. I had Horn's on my list of breakfast places to go in NOLA, so it was only a matter of time until I made it there (glad it was sooner rather than later). The interior is adorable- it feels homey and quaint, and you get the sense you're about to eat a delicious, filling meal that will warm your heart. My friend and I both ordered the Guatemalan- eggs, plantains, black beans, avocado, salsa, sour cream, and tortillas- and shared an order of the Sweet Potato Pancakes. The pancakes tasted like they came straight off the Thanksgiving dessert table- they tasted of cinnamon and nutmeg, reminiscent of ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","photo_id":"HPIXq0_DnwpcM9H71o9nJw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/HPIXq0_DnwpcM9H71o9nJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8783048391342163},{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","photo_id":"-EKTU-KgmXqI4Iw95scPqg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-EKTU-KgmXqI4Iw95scPqg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7757589817047119},{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","photo_id":"pDXAzDgk6RlssF4l-pDb3g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pDXAzDgk6RlssF4l-pDb3g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7658644318580627},{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","photo_id":"0LmaLuIUqu5NNrPPiDfj9Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0LmaLuIUqu5NNrPPiDfj9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7483986616134644},{"business_id":"Bt7NBqA31uOI4H_hvasLLg","photo_id":"pSWcxistPIHwTEyKxtHZkg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pSWcxistPIHwTEyKxtHZkg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7480252981185913}]},"notebook_case":null}
